reactor-flatpack-no-grid = The flatpack needs solid deck under it.
reactor-flatpack-needs-floor = There is not enough deck for the reactor's footing.
reactor-flatpack-needs-bare-floor = The reactor's footing must be bare plating; pull up any finished floor first.
reactor-flatpack-blocked = Something is in the way of the reactor's footing.
reactor-flatpack-pipe = A primary-layer pipe crosses the reactor's footing.
reactor-flatpack-atmos-device = An atmos device sits in the reactor's footing.

reactor-deconstruct-verb = Deconstruct reactor
reactor-deconstruct-running = The core is online. Shut it down first.
reactor-deconstruct-repair = The core is under repair and cannot be packed up.
reactor-deconstruct-hot = The core is still too hot to pack up.
reactor-deconstruct-melted = The core has melted down and cannot be packed up.
reactor-deconstruct-invalid = This reactor cannot be packed up.
reactor-deconstruct-done = The reactor folds back into its flatpack.
